# Staging in the viewport: `BOWSHOCK_EXAMPLE=two_stage cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/staging.drive out/staging`
# The two-stage example: separation seam and diamond, stage brackets under the body, the diamond selected.
viewport 1280x800
move (640, 400)
click "2D"
screenshot staging-profile.png
# Click the diamond: the separation is selected (filled diamond, accent tag).
click (690, 300)
screenshot staging-selected.png
click "3D"
screenshot staging-3d.png
# Phase: only the upper stage flies; the booster is faint.
click "Stage 2"
screenshot staging-phase.png
